UK SEO providers who publish their own, unbundled price for a named SEO service, checked 24 to 25 September 2026, quote a median entry-level monthly retainer of £497 (61 providers) and a median top-of-range price of £1,493.50 (34 of those 61 that also state a ceiling). 50% of UK-based or UK-serving providers checked publish a qualifying price at all; the rest show a market-range article, a bundled price, or no price.

The panel covers 75 UK agencies and freelancers with a published price, from 150 UK provider sites screened on 24 and 25 September 2026. The [method](#method) lists every inclusion and exclusion rule.

## How much does SEO cost in the UK? {% #headline-numbers %}

Among the 61 providers in this panel that publish an entry-level monthly retainer price, the median is £497/month. Among the 34 of those 61 that also publish a stated ceiling for that retainer, the median top price is £1,493.50/month.

{% stats %}
