{% stat value="£1,493.50/mo" label="median top-of-range retainer price, 34 of those 61 that state a ceiling" source="Sunny Patel, frozen panel of 75 UK providers" /%}
{% stat value="50%" label="share of UK-based or UK-serving, reachable SEO providers checked that publish their own, un-bundled SEO price" source="Sunny Patel, frozen panel of 75 UK providers" /%}
{% /stats %}

